## Tutorials

A grid container contains one or more grid items arranged in columns and rows.

All direct child elements of a grid container automatically become grid items.

An element becomes a grid container when itsdisplayproperty 
is set togridorinline-grid.

Try it Yourself »

The<div>element becomes a grid container when itsdisplayproperty 
is set togridorinline-grid.

### Code Examples

```
.container {
display: grid;
}

---

.container {
display: inline-grid;
}
```

